  "details": "## Description\n\nI clicked on edit profile and clicked \"Display age verification\" when i clicked save it said it failed but in my profile it displayed the 18+ verified badge even though i dont turn 18 until less than a month later.  It doesn't save between instances but can easily be redone and obviously luckily doesn't allow joining age gated instances. I am on Open Beta so please fix this before wide release so minors don't fake age verification more\n\n## Reproduction Steps\n\nBe age verified as a minor, go to edit profile in your bio, enable display age verification, click save even if it fails, in bio and abve your head the 18+ verification will be visible\n\n## Details\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1879-ecdbfcd219-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-07-25_02-55-29.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_ea07009a-8a49-492c-b720-c6a39f86bb4d/1/file)",
